"text": "So, did the Roadster fly? For a few seconds\u2026 yes. A car left the ground and used jets of air to turn itself over and land. That part is real, and it's genuinely new. The bigger idea, a flying car you can actually drive, is still unproven. And the version that flies isn't approved for the road. Tesla says production starts in 2028. [curious] Which matters more to you: the stunt\u2026 or the version people can actually drive?",
